menu "S3 control link"

config CONTROL_LINK_UART_TX_GPIO
    int "S3 control-link UART TX GPIO"
    default 5
    range 0 48
    help
        ESP32-S3 GPIO used for the UART signal from S3 to P4. The Seeed Studio
        XIAO ESP32S3 migration default is GPIO5 / D4 / SDA because GPIO12 is
        not exposed on this board.

config CONTROL_LINK_UART_RX_GPIO
    int "S3 control-link UART RX GPIO"
    default 6
    range 0 48
    help
        ESP32-S3 GPIO used for the UART signal from P4 to S3. The Seeed Studio
        XIAO ESP32S3 migration default is GPIO6 / D5 / SCL because GPIO13 is
        not exposed on this board.

endmenu
